SUMMARY:Wednesday Morning's Breakfast Rides  Casual Pace Variable Distance
  RSVP
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nDuring July and August ou
 r breakfast ride begins at 8:30. In case of excessive heat\, we will ride 
 shorter distances.\nEvery Wednesday morning...Ride and eat Yummy breakfast
  together. Around 25 miles.\nPlease do not go on this ride unless you will
  ride at a casual pace and stay with the group . We will meet to ride to b
 reakfast at a casual pace. After eating some may split up with some return
 ing to the start and others going longer and faster.\nHelmets are mandator
 y\; No ear buds or audible music playing devices. Please bring water\, and
  a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\nTo el
 iminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we encourage LBC Club memb
 ership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. RSVP also allows us to con
 tact you after the ride if needed. If you do not RSVP you are not covered 
 by the club excess accident insurance policy\; only club members who RSVP 
 are covered. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. Join her
 e- https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=25714
 8\nRichard Conner\, leader717-572-8480
